  "notes_en": "Cells give success and available SD, then cumulative optimizer tokens in millions. P-L: Life-Harness adaptation; P-S: SkillOpt evaluation; P*: original split; P2: adaptation-set peak pass@2; M: local measurement; H: historical release; F: common frozen WebShop environment; Q: pending adapter/resources. Each group retains its protocol."
